---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon';
---
<section class="report-container pb-16 pt-20 md:pb-24 md:pt-28">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text"><Icon name="evidence" size={18} /><span>Vision</span></div>
    <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl leading-[1.05] text-ink sm:text-6xl">A desk that helps you change position.</h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted">Open Smart Desk combines MoveUp, a desktop application, with a small sensor that measures desk height. The computer turns that signal into a gentle, context-aware nudge.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-ink-muted">The mission is simple: make a height-adjustable desk a desk people actually use.</p>
    <a class="focus-ring report-link mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2" href="/versions">Follow the project log <Icon name="external" size={16} /></a>
  </div>
</section>
